###
### Transport Booking Service - Sample HTTP Requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or import to Postman
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### =====================================================
### SERVICE POSTS
### =====================================================

### 1. Create a new service post (draft)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "ownerId": 1,
  "origin": "Zipaquirá",
  "destination": "Bogotá",
  "departureDateTime": "2025-11-15T08:00:00",
  "seatsTotal": 4,
  "price": 15000.00,
  "description": "Viaje directo por autopista Norte. Vehículo cómodo y puntual."
}

###

### 2. Publish a service post (make it available for reservations)
# Replace {postId} with actual post ID from previous response
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/post-001/publish
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 3. Get post by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/post-001
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 4. List all available posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 5. Search posts by route
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/search?origin=Zipaquirá&destination=Bogotá
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### =====================================================
### RESERVATIONS
### =====================================================

### 6. Create a reservation (reserve seats)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/post-001/reserve
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userId": 10,
  "seats": 2
}

###

### 7. Confirm a reservation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reservations/res-003/confirm
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 8. Cancel a reservation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reservations/res-003/cancel
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###

### 9. Get user's reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/10/reservations
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 10. Get post's reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/post-001/reservations
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### =====================================================
### MONITORING & HEALTH
### =====================================================

### 11. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 12. Metrics (Prometheus format)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain

###
